5
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:35,500
さあ 今日はどんな味がホ・シ・イ？
Now, what kind of taste do I want today?

6
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:39,500
囁く悪魔の誘惑 what do you want?
The whispering devil's temptation—what do you want?

7
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:45,000
Ah, Sickbay で待ち合わせ Mistakeなヨカン 扉開けてさあこっちへおいで
Ah, meeting in the sickbay, a mistake's hunch—open the door and come right over here.

8
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:51,500
教科書に載っていない この気持ちは何ですか？
What is this feeling not written in any textbook?

9
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:55,500
可愛い可愛い顔みせて
Show me your cute, cute face.

10
00:02:55,800 --> 00:03:00,000
Sickbayで会いましょう Mistakeしちゃう？
Let's meet in the sickbay—might we make a mistake?

11
00:03:00,300 --> 00:03:04,000
永遠に続け 時間よ止まって
Lasting forever, time please stop.

12
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:11,500
教室じゃみせられない 笑顔の秘密は 甘い甘いお菓子あげる
The secret to the smile I can't show in the classroom: I'll give you sweet, sweet treats.

13
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:15,500
囁く悪魔の誘惑 い・か・が
The whispering devil's temptation—how about it?

14
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:28,000
秒針のリズム 追い越してく
