15
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:32,000
聴かせて もっと キミの鼓動
Let me hear more of your heartbeat.

16
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:35,500
触れる視線で 身体中騒ぐの
With touching gazes, my whole body stirs.

17
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:41,500
もうどうしようもないくらい
To the point where nothing can be done.

18
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:45,500
禁断の果実 甘い
Forbidden fruit so sweet.

19
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:51,500
もう後に戻れない
There's no turning back now.

20
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:55,500
目が合って はにかんで 触れ合って 見つめ合って
Eyes meeting, shy smiles, touching, gazing at each other...

21
00:03:55,800 --> 00:04:00,000
永遠の楽園に誘う愛の言葉を 耳元で囁いてあげる
...whispering words of love into your ear, inviting you to eternal paradise.

22
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:03,800
Sickbayで待ってるわ Mistakeな時間
Waiting in the sickbay, a time of mistakes.

23
00:04:04,100 --> 00:04:08,500
扉閉めて もっと近づいて
Close the door and come even closer.

24
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,500
神様も止められない この気持ちの正体を
Even God cannot stop the true nature of this feeling.

25
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:16,500
知らないふりはもう出来ない
I can no longer pretend I don't know.

26
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:22,000
Sickbayで会いたいの Mistakeしましょう
I want to meet in the sickbay—let's make a mistake.

27
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:26,500
永遠はここにあるって信じて
Believing that eternity is right here.

28
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:30,500
キミにしかみせられない笑顔の裏側
The hidden side of the smile I show only to you.

29
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:35,000
甘い 甘い 果実あげる
I'll give you sweet, sweet fruit.

30
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:39,000
囁く悪魔の誘惑もっといかが？
How about more of the whispering devil's temptation?

31
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:43,500
いつでもここでまってる My cute student
Always waiting right here for you, my cute student.

32
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:58,500
Sickbayで会いましょう
Let's meet in the sickbay...

33
00:05:09,322 --> 00:05:15,552
みんな、来てくれてありがとう！
Thank you everyone for coming!

34
